{0 The Publicodes compiler internals}

{1 Architecture}

The compiler is divided into different passes, each one applies different
transformations:
1. Yaml parsing - `./yaml_parser`
2. Parsing - `./parser`
3. Desugaring - `./resolver`
4. Resolution of _remplacements_ - `./replacements`
5. Type inference - `./typed_tree`
6. Outputs - `./hashed_tree`
